data: {"id": "33db0b6f48f34951-thinking-parallel_evidence-218", "run_id": "33db0b6f48f34951", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "开始执行首轮证据采集计划。先并行获取 Kubernetes 描述、Pod YAML 和拓扑，以及已有的可观测性基线（Metrics/Logs/Tracing 已在前置执行中返回结果）。\n\n**步骤 1：Kubernetes 核心事实采集**\n- `kubectl get pod workload -n aiops-case-v12 -o yaml`：确认 deletionTimestamp、finalizers、node 等关键状态。\n- `kubectl describe pod workload -n aiops-case-v12`：获取终止相关事件。\n- `query_pod_topology`：获取控制器和节点关系。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789365414719, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

